"\n"
"What it does\n"
"============\n"
"This module will change color navigate bar, button and logo,v.v in Sale following Viindoo's brand\n"
"\n"
"Editions Supported\n"
"==================\n"
"1. Community Edition\n"
"2. Enterprise Edition\n"
"\n"
